"""
RAG 50-Question Information Retrieval Benchmark Runner for EduPath AI.
Evaluates Hybrid Dense + BM25 Lexical Retrieval and Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF) Reranking
across 50 comprehensive Computer Science questions spanning 8 core domains.

Target Metrics:
- Precision@3 >= 0.70
- Mean Reciprocal Rank (MRR) >= 0.75
"""

